<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Selected projects by Yifei Felix Wang: technology, games, and art."/><title>The menu — After Hours / Felix Wang</title><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/></head><body><main id="main" class="static-work-page"><a class="static-back" href="/">← Step into the diner</a><article><p class="paper-eyebrow">FELIX WANG’S AFTER HOURS</p><h1>House specials.</h1><p>Technology, games, art, and other curious things I’ve made.</p>{projects.map(project=><a class="diner-menu-item" href={`/work/${project.slug}/`}><span class="dish-number">{project.number}</span><div class="dish-info"><div class="dish-name"><h4>{project.name}</h4><span class="dish-dots"></span><span class="dish-year">{project.year}</span></div><p>{project.description}</p><span class="dish-type">{project.type}</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}<section id="side-projects"><h2>On the side.</h2><p>Indie games, fine art, and custom 3D-printed toys. I like following an idea beyond the screen.</p><a href="/#on-the-side">Open the notebook in the diner ↗</a></section><section id="about-felix"><h2>Hi, I’m Felix.</h2><p>I build cool tech stuff to make people happy. Outside of making things: art, cats, games, and a very good meal.</p><p><a href="mailto:wangyifeifelix@gmail.com">wangyifeifelix@gmail.com ↗</a></p></section></article></main></body></html>
